WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
She needs to get out, grow up.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.760
She's dressing up as a law enforcement officer

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:09.160
and jumping in as if she's trained to do any of this.

00:00:09.160 --> 00:00:12.320
She's not, and she shouldn't be part of this at all.

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:14.680
In fact, she's getting it all wrong,

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:18.559
and she's, in fact, ginning it up, causing problems.

